  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.23 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Landscape Architects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.23 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Landscape Architects. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.23, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of landscape architects under RSA 310-A:140-160:\n\nTable 1002.23 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Landscape Architects\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nLandscape architect license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $176\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35 (formerly Plc 1002.22)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
